{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","number":35,"title":"Konzession & Abwägen","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Grundsätzlich bin ich mit der Fusion einverstanden","speaker":"Nadja","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich räume ein dass die Fusion Vorteile hat","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Weitgehend stimme ich zu aber die Aussagekraft der Zahlen ist gering","speaker":"Nadja","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Insgesamt sollten wir trotzdem zustimmen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Gut dann unterschreibe ich den Vertrag morgen","speaker":"Nadja","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"grundsätzlich","voiceRole":"female","pos":"adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"grundsätzlich","voiceRole":"male","pos":"adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"weitgehend","voiceRole":"female","pos":"adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"weitgehend","voiceRole":"male","pos":"adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"die Aussagekraft","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"die Aussagekraft","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"einräumen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"einräumen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"insgesamt","voiceRole":"female","pos":"adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"insgesamt","voiceRole":"male","pos":"adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Die Ergebnisse einer aktuellen Phase-III-Studie sind vielversprechend müssen jedoch aufgrund der kurzen Beobachtungsdauer vorsichtig interpretiert werden","authoredText":"Die Ergebnisse einer aktuellen Phase-III-Studie sind vielversprechend, müssen jedoch aufgrund der kurzen Beobachtungsdauer vorsichtig interpretiert werden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Fachartikel: Neues Diabetes-Medikament in der Diskussion","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, ich bin grundsätzlich für die Fusion — sie würde beiden Unternehmen enorme Vorteile bringen.","speaker":"Nadja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Zugegeben, die Vorteile sind beachtlich, aber die Zahlen im letzten Quartal geben mir doch zu denken.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Ein berechtigter Einwand, obwohl die Zahlen klein sind, sollten wir sie nicht einfach ignorieren.","speaker":"Nadja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Genau, lass uns die Risiken und Chancen noch einmal in Ruhe gegeneinander abwägen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, ich bin grundsätzlich für die Fusion — sie würde beiden Unternehmen enorme Vorteile bringen.","speaker":"Nadja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Zugegeben, die Vorteile sind beachtlich, aber die Zahlen im letzten Quartal geben mir doch zu denken.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Ein berechtigter Einwand, obwohl die Zahlen klein sind, sollten wir sie nicht einfach ignorieren.","speaker":"Nadja","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Genau, lass uns die Risiken und Chancen noch einmal in Ruhe gegeneinander abwägen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_035_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Zugegeben, die Vorteile sind beachtlich, aber die Zahlen sind dünn.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Timo ist grundsätzlich für die Fusion. Räume die Vorteile ein.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Grundsätzlich gilt der Zusammenhang, weitgehend jedoch nur für Städte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Deine Betreuerin findet deine Aussage zu absolut. Relativiere.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Die Aussagekraft ist begrenzt, weil nur zwei Regionen einbezogen wurden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Ein Gutachter fragt nach der Aussagekraft deiner Studie.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Einerseits erreicht es viele Familien, andererseits fehlt die Wirkungskontrolle.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Bewerte im Seminar ein Förderprogramm ausgewogen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Insgesamt halte ich das Vorhaben für sinnvoll, wenngleich riskant.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-35-konzession-und-abwaegen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Zieh im Fazit die Gesamtbewertung.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":5,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":5,"vword-voice-M":5,"vword-listen":5,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Die","from":"reading","type":"Article","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"Ergebnisse","from":"reading","type":"Noun · plural","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"einer","from":"reading","type":"Article · Gen.","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"aktuellen","from":"reading","type":"Adjective · Gen.","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"Phase-III-Studie","from":"reading","type":"Noun · fem.","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"sind","from":"reading","type":"Verb · sein","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"vielversprechend","from":"reading","type":"Adjective","role":"plain"},{"n":1,"w":"müssen","from":"reading","type":"Verb · Modalverb","role":"r-konzession"},{"n":1,"w":"jedoch","from":"reading","type":"Adverb","role":"r-konzessi